        "text": "Write one **command** per line (UPPERCASE, an optional trailing colon \u2014 see the [[Fedwiki DSL Skill]] convention):\n\n- `POD` \u2014 `PARENT` and `SISTERS` together (shorthand)\n- `SISTERS` \u2014 sibling sites sharing the parent domain\n- `PARENT` \u2014 the parent-domain site itself\n- `CHILDREN` \u2014 direct sub-domains of this site\n- `DESCENDANTS` \u2014 all sub-domains, any depth\n- `FARM` \u2014 every wiki in the farm\n- `NEIGHBOURHOOD` \u2014 the sites currently in your neighborhood\n- `SNAPSHOT` \u2014 freeze the current neighborhood *(same as NEIGHBOURHOOD)*\n\nAnd two **actions** (not site-kinds):\n\n- `FREEZE` \u2014 show a button that saves the gathered pod as a **roster ghost page** (one roster item per kind), so an ephemeral panel becomes a forkable page.\n- `FORK` \u2014 filter the gathered pod down to the members whose sitemap already holds **this page's slug** \u2014 who in your pod has *forked* the page you are viewing."
